   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick a file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 3.5 GB |\n| `vae/` | [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors) | 0.5 GB |\n\nFrom [Comfy-Org/SeedVR2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2). Licence: Apache-2.0 (SeedVR2 by ByteDance Seed).\n\n**Requirements**\n- Core ComfyUI nodes only. Built and run on ComfyUI 0.45.3; older versions were not run.\n- VRAM: 9.3 GiB in a 10 GiB budget for 960x1728 (process peak, see How to use). System RAM: 19.0 to 20.3 GiB for a 5 s clip.\n- Not verified on a real 12 GB card.\n"
   ]
  }
